{"id":"1e69578d4ad3ac07","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-uniqueness-right-adjoints.md","title":"Theorem — Uniqueness of Right Adjoints","display":"Theorem — Uniqueness of Right Adjoints","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-uniqueness-right-adjoints","aliases":["14-thm-uniqueness-right-adjoints"],"display":"Theorem — Uniqueness of Right Adjoints","depends_on":["[[14-df-adjoint-functors]]","[[14-df-natural-transformation]]","[[14-df-category]]"],"source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-uniqueness-right-adjoints"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-uniqueness-right-adjoints</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — Uniqueness of Right Adjoints"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d2b4e5cf16585f95\" href=\"?note=d2b4e5cf16585f95\" title=\"14-df-adjoint-functors\">14-df-adjoint-functors</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1bdaf4a293143165\" href=\"?note=1bdaf4a293143165\" title=\"14-df-natural-transformation\">14-df-natural-transformation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsAdjunction}(F,G),\\mathrm{IsAdjunction}(F,G&#39;)\">\\(\\mathrm{IsAdjunction}(F,G),\\mathrm{IsAdjunction}(F,G&#39;)\\)</span> (adjunctions, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d2b4e5cf16585f95\" href=\"?note=d2b4e5cf16585f95\" title=\"14-df-adjoint-functors\">14-df-adjoint-functors</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsNatural}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsNatural}\\)</span> (natural-transformation predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1bdaf4a293143165\" href=\"?note=1bdaf4a293143165\" title=\"14-df-natural-transformation\">14-df-natural-transformation</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ob}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ob}\\)</span> (object-set operation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{id}\">\\(\\mathrm{id}\\)</span> (identity assignment, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D\">\\(F:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G,G&#39;:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal C\">\\(G,G&#39;:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal C\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D\">\\(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D\\)</span> 为固定范畴。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(\\mathrm{IsAdjunction}(F,G)\\land\\mathrm{IsAdjunction}(F,G&#39;)\\bigr)\\to\\exists\\alpha,\\beta\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{IsNatural}(\\alpha,G,G&#39;)\\land\\mathrm{IsNatural}(\\beta,G&#39;,G)\\land\\forall D\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal D)\\;(\\beta_D\\circ\\alpha_D=\\mathrm{id}_{\\mathcal C}(G(D))\\land\\alpha_D\\circ\\beta_D=\\mathrm{id}_{\\mathcal C}(G&#39;(D)))\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(\\mathrm{IsAdjunction}(F,G)\\land\\mathrm{IsAdjunction}(F,G&#39;)\\bigr)\\to\\exists\\alpha,\\beta\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{IsNatural}(\\alpha,G,G&#39;)\\land\\mathrm{IsNatural}(\\beta,G&#39;,G)\\land\\forall D\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal D)\\;(\\beta_D\\circ\\alpha_D=\\mathrm{id}_{\\mathcal C}(G(D))\\land\\alpha_D\\circ\\beta_D=\\mathrm{id}_{\\mathcal C}(G&#39;(D)))\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定位：Categorical Preliminaries，右伴随唯一性，印刷页 19；DjVu 第 15 图页。</p>\n<p>从两个伴随的 Hom 自然双射合成，得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Hom}(A,G(D))\\cong\\mathrm{Hom}(A,G&#39;(D))\">\\(\\mathrm{Hom}(A,G(D))\\cong\\mathrm{Hom}(A,G&#39;(D))\\)</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 自然。将恒等箭头送过去得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha_D\">\\(\\alpha_D\\)</span>，反向得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta_D\">\\(\\beta_D\\)</span>；自然性及两次送回恒等得到互逆。这也说明得到的是自然同构，并非对象逐个的任意同构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"d2b4e5cf16585f95","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-adjoint-functors]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-natural-transformation","status":"resolved","id":"1bdaf4a293143165","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-natural-transformation]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"28211adc1b0ce5bc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"d2b4e5cf16585f95","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsAdjunction}(F,G),\\mathrm{IsAdjunction}(F,G')$ (adjunctions, see [[14-df-adjoint-functors]])","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-natural-transformation","status":"resolved","id":"1bdaf4a293143165","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsNatural}$ (natural-transformation predicate, see [[14-df-natural-transformation]])","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"28211adc1b0ce5bc","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ob}$ (object-set operation, see [[14-df-category]])","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"28211adc1b0ce5bc","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{id}$ (identity assignment, see [[14-df-category]])","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsAdjunction}(F,G),\\mathrm{IsAdjunction}(F,G')","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsNatural}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ob}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{id}","display":false},{"tex":"F:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"G,G':\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigl(\\mathrm{IsAdjunction}(F,G)\\land\\mathrm{IsAdjunction}(F,G')\\bigr)\\to\\exists\\alpha,\\beta\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{IsNatural}(\\alpha,G,G')\\land\\mathrm{IsNatural}(\\beta,G',G)\\land\\forall D\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal D)\\;(\\beta_D\\circ\\alpha_D=\\mathrm{id}_{\\mathcal C}(G(D))\\land\\alpha_D\\circ\\beta_D=\\mathrm{id}_{\\mathcal C}(G'(D)))\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Hom}(A,G(D))\\cong\\mathrm{Hom}(A,G'(D))","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha_D","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta_D","display":false}],"bytes":1694,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-19","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-uniqueness-right-adjoints|Theorem — Uniqueness of Right Adjoints]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-uniqueness-right-adjoints]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-uniqueness-right-adjoints]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-20","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-uniqueness-right-adjoints|Theorem — Uniqueness of Right Adjoints]]"}],"outgoing":["d2b4e5cf16585f95","1bdaf4a293143165","28211adc1b0ce5bc"]}